===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{lb|en|pathology}} A condition in which [[tissue]]s are deprived of an adequate supply of [[oxygen]] {{defdate|from 1940s}}.
#: {{ant|en|hyperoxia}}
#: {{hyper|en|underoxygenation}}
#: {{hypo|en|anoxia|stagnant hypoxia}}
#: {{cot|en|normoxia|pseudohypoxia}}
# A reduced concentration of dissolved oxygen in an [[aquatic]] environment.
#: {{ant|en|hyperoxia}}
#: {{hyper|en|underoxygenation}}
#: {{hypo|en|anoxia}}
#: {{cot|en|normoxia}}

